title: Start_Penelope
---
<<declare $penelope_TalkTo = 0>>

//Dialogue Jumper
<<if $penelope_TalkTo == 1>>
   <<jump Filler1_Penelope>>
<<elseif $penelope_TalkTo == 2>>
   <<jump AfterCooking_Penelope>>
<<endif>>


Penelope: When I heard there was a new person who had come to town, I just had to meet them
Penelope: And young too! There’s no one in this town my age. They’re either old enough to croquet, or young enough to not know what croqueting is.

Penelope: But anyways, name’s Penelope!

Penelope: Though you can just call me Penny, that’s what most people ‘round here call me.

Dawn: I’m Dawn.

Penelope: Dawn… that’s a nice name! Very hopeful.

Dawn: Aha, thank you.

Penelope: So what brings you to this dumpty little town?

    -> I needed a new start.
        Dawn: I needed a new start, and my Grandma left me this property in her will. So, I figured, why not?
    -> Grams gave me her house.
        Dawn: Grams left me her house and cafe in the will.
    -> I like the town.
        Dawn: This town has more... space than the city. I was starting to suffocate, so I took the opportunity to move.

Penelope: Well, fancy that. And here of all places. Did you even know this place existed before?

Dawn: Not at all. Lawyers showed me on the map when they told me about it.

Dawn: While you’re here, would you like anything to eat?

Penelope: It all looks so nice! What do you recommend?

Dawn: Well, I was just working on a mean eggs and toast. Wanna try it?

Penelope: I haven’t had a chance to eat breakfast yet. So, show me what you’ve got!


<<set $penelope_TalkTo to 1>>
===


title: Filler1_Penelope
---
Penelope: You sux!
===


title: AfterCooking_Penelope
---
Penelope: Golly, this looks good. And it tastes good too!

Penelope: It tastes… savoury and… sweet? What did you put in it?

Dawn: Trade secret. Gotta keep Grams secrets under lock and key.

Penelope: Aw, man. Fair enough. Can I get a doggy bag? I would love to keep some for my mum to try.

Dawn: Sure thing. Here you go.

Penelope: Well, I’ve gotta run now. It was nice meeting you Dawn!

Penelope: I’ll pop back another time.

Dawn: See ya, Penny.
===